# The Quest for Granny's Hat (shipped as questgran.quest) — Quest 5, ASL 580, QuestViva oracle
#
# ENDING REACHED: the WIN — `give grannys hat to granny gumdrop`
#   ("**CONGRATULATIONS** You have found Granny Gumdrop's hat and saved the day.").
#   No published walkthrough; derived from game.aslx. The five other `finish`
#   sites are deaths at the wizard's hands (history book, plain mirror, knife,
#   dawdling five turns) or from wearing his cursed robe.
#
# CHAIN: house — blue key and silver coin (bedroom), paraffin lamp (shed), jar of
#   honey, foot cream and raw meat (kitchen/larder). Foot cream -> Farmer Bogwort
#   -> fishing rod. Village — "ask roundel about special" -> woollen hat; coin ->
#   Sweet Rita -> creme brulee; "ask giselle about arnold" -> bag of crisps. Rod on
#   the jetty -> sea bass. Brulee -> Custard -> mirror; bass -> the bear in the dark
#   back passage (lamp lit) -> Keyette. Home again: crisps -> Arnold -> polishing
#   cloth, cloth on mirror -> Super Mirror. Tower (blue key): fill the bathroom
#   bottle, open the honey jar with the kitchen jar opener (frees Wizard
#   Whidehatte), reflect his spell with the Super Mirror at once -> study key;
#   Keyette opens Boxette, water grows the dehydrated ladder, ladder under the
#   third-floor hatch, meat -> Ma crow, woollen hat -> Pa crow -> Granny's hat.
#
# "granny" alone is ambiguous once the hat is held (Granny Gumdrop / Grannys
#   hat), hence the full names in the last command.
